  "description": "Change of use of existing dwelling house (Class C3a) to 9 classroom (plus ancillary spaces) school for girls accommodating 130 pupils and 20 staff (Class D1), together with excavation of existing basement and front and rear garden areas to provide school accommodation in the basement including creation of front and rear lightwells and installation of new windows and doors; external alterations to elevations including the installation of new windows and doors to front and rear; erection of a single storey ground floor rear extension; erection of dormer extension to rear roof slope; installation of a roof light to front slope and the provision of brick bin store enclosure in front garden. Proposed opening hours 08:00 hours to 18:00 hours on Monday to Friday only and not all on Saturdays, Sundays/Bank holidays.",
